{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09193","headline":"酬韩质舟行阻冻 · 韦应物","name":"酬韩质舟行阻冻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨坐枉嘉藻，持此慰寝兴。\n中获辛苦奏，长河结阴冰。\n皓曜羣玉发，凄清孤景凝。\n至柔反成坚，造化安可恒。\n方舟未得行，凿饮空兢兢。\n寒苦弥时节，待泮岂所能。\n何必涉广川，荒衢且升腾。\n殷勤宣中意，庶用达吾朋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}